      "eyebrow": "How Quickler helps",
      "heading": "Doing the check in WhatsApp",
      "html": "<p>Walk the route. Answer each item in WhatsApp by text or voice note, and send a photo of the reversing area, the signs or any fault as you go. The person on the job needs no new app and no login. When you say done, Quickler writes the record in your own report layout, with a timestamp and the site address. Open items stay on the dashboard until someone closes them.</p><p>Same rule as every Quickler record: names, numbers and identifiers on the record have to come from something said, sent or photographed on the walk. You supply the facts. Quickler does the typing.</p><p>That typing is the saving: 1 to 2 hours down to 14 minutes on average at Ethos Safety.</p>"
    },
